Package: mcp-hub-tools
Version: __VERSION__
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), openssh-client, systemd
Recommends: tailscale
Maintainer: server-mcp-gemini project <noreply@example.invalid>
Homepage: https://github.com/mienkek13-netizen/server-mcp-gemini
Description: Hub-side tools for the server-mcp-gemini Windows-PC tunnel fleet
 Installs hub-diagnostics.py (local health checks for pc-tunnel@.service
 instances, Tailscale, and disk space) and hub-cli.py (manage PC tunnel
 config, pin SSH host keys, and read/write the Render-hosted service's
 env vars) as /usr/bin/hub-diagnostics and /usr/bin/hub-cli, plus the
 pc-tunnel@.service systemd template these tools manage.
 .
 Also installs an opt-in auto-update timer (disabled by default) that
 checks GitHub Releases for a newer version of this package and
 installs it automatically -- see /usr/share/doc/mcp-hub-tools/README
 for how to enable it.
